    chown -R ${SPACK_ADMIN_USER}:admin ${SPACK_INSTALL_TREE}

── Layer 2: Spack mirror — require GPG signature for cache installs ─────────────

  Set signed: true on arch mirror in /apps/helpers/spack/intel/mirrors.yaml:
    arch:
