── Full deploy workflow ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  ${SPACK_ADMIN_USER} only (has signing key + owns install_tree):
    spackon -i -arch-push    →  install to tree + sign + push to ARCH cache

  any admin user (read access, trusted key):
    spackon --keys trust
    spack -C /apps/helpers/spack/intel install --use-buildcache only <pkg>
    # installs signed binary from cache into tree (no source build)

── Stage 0: one-time system setup (${SPACK_ADMIN_USER} only, requires sudo) ─────

  Run once to create all shared directories with correct ownership:
